category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libevent-devel libhwloc-devel libopenmpi-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Parallel solvers for sparse linear systems featuring multigrid methods (utilities)"
ldesc: "HYPRE is a library of high performance preconditioners and solvers featuring
multigrid methods for the solution of large, sparse linear systems of
equations on massively parallel computers."
